{"about_the_game":"Hypogea is a short, atmospheric 3D platformer where you take the role of a staff-wielding automaton trying to escape from an abandoned underground megastructure.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980260/extras/0ee8edc9aebc185fe299cda3cbb4e6c7.poster.avif?t=1758904548\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980260/extras/0ee8edc9aebc185fe299cda3cbb4e6c7.webm?t=1758904548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980260/extras/0ee8edc9aebc185fe299cda3cbb4e6c7.mp4?t=1758904548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Travel through the mysterious structure using your hooked staff to pole-vault, swing, climb, catch yourself and more.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980260/extras/f07a7d7eecb00fa810c8636046691356.poster.avif?t=1758904548\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980260/extras/f07a7d7eecb00fa810c8636046691356.webm?t=1758904548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980260/extras/f07a7d7eecb00fa810c8636046691356.mp4?t=1758904548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Restore the puzzling mechanisms of the facility and help its automaton inhabitants.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980260/extras/b4c4231eae60f33b46ce584156b7eb5c.poster.avif?t=1758904548\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea